== Effects ==
* Deals 10 damage to all enemies in the room and [[Status Effects#Slow|slows]] them for 4 seconds.
* {{dlc|r}} Enemies killed by Spider Butt spawn 1-3 [[Blue Spider]]s.
* {{transformation contribution|Spider Baby}}

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns white wisps in the middle ring, looking like a spider. Wisps' tears have a 7.5% chance to inflict [[slow]] on enemies.}}

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Deals 10 damage to enemies twice but does not increase slow effect.

